            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Trigger a scheduled report to be sent immediately with fresh execution.\n\nReturns 202 Accepted immediately; the report is generated and emailed\nin the background. Check the schedule's runs endpoint for status."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Get Schedule Runs Endpoint",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://api.myaltimate.com/playground/schedules/:schedule_id/runs",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "schedule_id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path"
              },
              {
                "name": "limit",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Get recent runs for a schedule."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Get Sessions",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://api.myaltimate.com/playground/sessions",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "search_text",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              },
              {
                "name": "page",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Page number starting from 1"
              },
              {
                "name": "page_size",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Number of items per page"
              },
              {
                "name": "status",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "active (default), archived, or all (active+archived)"
              },
              {
                "name": "navigationSource",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Get all AI playground sessions for a user with pagination support for infinite scroll"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Get Session By Id",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://api.myaltimate.com/playground/sessions/:session_id",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "session_id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path"
              },
              {
                "name": "navigationSource",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Get a specific AI playground session by ID with its turns"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Update Session Status",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "url": "https://api.myaltimate.com/playground/sessions/:session_id",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "session_id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path"
              },
              {
                "name": "navigationSource",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Archive (``archived``), restore (``active``), or soft-delete\n(``deleted``) a single session owned by the authenticated user.\nSoft-deleted sessions remain in the database. It will be backed\ninto s3 later."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Ask Session",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.myaltimate.com/playground/ask",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "navigationSource",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Ask a question in an AI playground session and get streaming response.\n\nThe actual pipeline (security scan, output guard, service invocation,\nstreaming) lives in ``app.service.ai_playground.ask_pipeline.run_ask_pipeline``\nso it can be reused by the playground scheduler worker without an HTTP\ncallback. This endpoint is now a thin transport wrapper."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Enhance Prompt",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.myaltimate.com/playground/prompt/enhance",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Enhance a user prompt - Temporary proxy to actual prompt enhancer"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Session To Pdf",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.myaltimate.com/playground/session_to_pdf",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "navigationSource",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Generate a PDF report from the full conversation thread of a session.\nIncludes all user questions and assistant answers."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Session To Email Mailing List",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.myaltimate.com/playground/session_to_email_mailing_list",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "navigationSource",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Generate a PDF from the full conversation thread and send via email.\n\nRecipients are resolved from ``recipient_type``:\n- ``specific_emails``: the explicit, regex-validated ``emails`` list (To)\n- ``all_altimate_users``: every active tenant user (BCC fan-out)\n- ``team``: active members of the selected teams (BCC fan-out)"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Cancel Session",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.myaltimate.com/playground/cancel",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "navigationSource",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Cancel an active AI playground session"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "List Agents",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://api.myaltimate.com/playground/agents",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "List all production agents from Langfuse.\n\nFetches the agent names from the 'agent-names' prompt config,\nthen retrieves full details (name, version, prompt, config, labels) for each agent."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Create Or Update Agent",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.myaltimate.com/playground/agents",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Create or update an agent definition in Langfuse.\n\nNote: We use create_prompt for both create and update because:\n- create_prompt automatically creates a new version if the name exists\n- update_prompt only modifies labels on existing versions, not content"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Delete Agent",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "https://api.myaltimate.com/playground/agents",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Deprecate an agent by removing it from production and marking as deprecated."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Get Agent",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://api.myaltimate.com/playground/agents/:agent_name",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "agent_name",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Get an agent definition from Langfuse."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Add Agent To Production",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.myaltimate.com/playground/agents/production/add",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Add an agent to the production agents list (agent-names config.agents)."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Remove Agent From Production",
            "type": "http"
